          "Label the booking list and the academic calendar with their versions so a later reviewer can tell a stale extract from a current one. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. Write the note so a reviewer can reconstruct the decision without a meeting. A sample room booking conflict review checks the booking list, the academic calendar, and the surviving value in the room system. The educationvirtualassistant coordinator files the dated room booking conflict note with the case.",
          "Avoid a private second version in a personal document. Make the handoff readable by the next shift and the next auditor. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Apply the same room booking conflict test to the conflict note and to the value that survives in the room system. The educationvirtualassistant queue checks the room booking conflict record against its named reviewer.",
          "Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. Write the note so a reviewer can reconstruct the decision without a meeting. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. The room booking conflict record should let a second reviewer rebuild the decision from the academic calendar and the conflict note. The educationvirtualassistant coordinator files the dated room booking conflict note with the case."
